  - 'Jarvuy: It''s a trap!  Get out of there.'
  - 'Anhsirk: Crikey!  Looks like you could use a hand.'
  - 'Jarvuy: Never thought I''d see your face around here general...'
  - 'Anhsirk: Righteo let''s finish this once and for all.'
  - 'Anhsirk: Struth!  Looks like the galaxy just got a little more safe.'
  - 'Jarvuy: Yeeeehaw!!  You did it!'
  dialogueText: {fileID: 284262030}
